{"title":"CUSTOM CUES","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"asset-pack-85615640578-example-product-3","title":"Wenge wood x Ahswood (Butt Only)","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eFeatures\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Ashwood handle for a clean, elegant appearance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRich Wenge wood forearm and butt sleeve with beautiful natural grain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGenuine abalone inlays that shimmer under light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision-machined Radial 3\/8×8 pin for a solid, consistent hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandcrafted by experienced cue makers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent balance and feedback for competitive play\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh-gloss finish for durability and a luxurious look\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEach cue is unique due to the natural characteristics of the wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43435908825136,"sku":null,"price":30000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_28_2026_10_28_46_AM.png?v=1785205740"},{"product_id":"cm-002","title":"Ashwood x Wenge wood (Butt Only)","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eFeatures\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e18 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Ashwood forearm with beautiful natural grain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRich Wenge wood handle and butt sleeve\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGenuine abalone inlays for a luxurious appearance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision-machined Radial 3\/8×8 joint for a solid, consistent hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntricate decorative ringwork\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandcrafted by skilled cue makers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh-gloss finish for lasting beauty and durability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent balance and playability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEvery cue features unique natural wood grain, making each piece one of a kind\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43439360999472,"sku":null,"price":30000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_28_2026_04_00_23_PM.png?v=1785225639"},{"product_id":"pampanga-dragon-001","title":"Dragon - X002 (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eA striking blend of traditional craftsmanship and premium exotic materials, this handcrafted custom cue is designed for players and collectors who appreciate elegance, precision, and exceptional detail. The cue features a stunning hand-inlaid dragon motif crafted from genuine Mother of Pearl and Abalone, creating a captivating centerpiece that reflects beautifully under any lighting.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt with a rich \u003cstrong\u003eEbony wood handle\u003c\/strong\u003e for a solid, balanced feel, and complemented by a beautifully figured \u003cstrong\u003eWenge wood forearm and butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue offers both timeless aesthetics and outstanding performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLength:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial 3\/8 × 8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wenge Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wenge Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Genuine Mother of Pearl \u0026amp; Abalone Dragon Inlay\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43439507963952,"sku":null,"price":40000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul28_2026_04_08_28PM.png?v=1785226129"},{"product_id":"tri-cut-spalted-tamarind-custom-cue-with-torrefied-maple-shaft","title":"Tri-Cut Spalted Tamarind Custom Cue with Torrefied Maple Shaft","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted for players who appreciate both performance and artistry, this custom cue blends premium materials with precision craftsmanship. The striking \u003cstrong\u003etri-cut Spalted Tamarind handle\u003c\/strong\u003e showcases the natural beauty of exotic wood, while the \u003cstrong\u003eEbony forearm and butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e provide timeless elegance and exceptional durability. Finished with shimmering \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, every cue is handcrafted to stand out on and off the table.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for a smooth, consistent hit, it features a \u003cstrong\u003eTorrefied Maple shaft\u003c\/strong\u003e that offers increased stability, reduced deflection, and excellent feedback. Combined with a \u003cstrong\u003eJuma ferrule\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue delivers exceptional cue ball control, spin, and accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOverall Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 59 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tri-Cut Spalted Tamarind\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Genuine Abalone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShaft:\u003c\/strong\u003e Torrefied Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip Diameter:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12.5 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTaper:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pro Taper\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/strong\u003e Juma\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Diamond\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandcrafted using premium exotic hardwoods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBeautiful tri-cut Spalted Tamarind handle with unique natural grain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElegant abalone inlays for a luxurious finish\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStable Torrefied Maple shaft for a crisp, consistent hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision-machined radial pin for a solid, reliable joint connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth pro taper for effortless stroke and cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt for serious players who demand performance without compromising style\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is individually handcrafted, making each piece one of a kind. The natural wood grain ensures no two cues are ever exactly alike.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43445513715760,"sku":null,"price":45000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul30_2026_08_22_24PM.png?v=1785414159"},{"product_id":"cm-003-butt-only","title":"Maple x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eDesigned for players who value both performance and eye-catching craftsmanship, this custom cue combines premium materials with timeless point construction. The forearm and butt sleeve feature striking maple points accented with vibrant resin, while the matching resin handle provides a comfortable grip and a unique marbled appearance. Elegant abalone inlays add a refined finishing touch, making this cue stand out on and off the table.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLength:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\" Butt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin \u0026amp; Maple Points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin \u0026amp; Maple Points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Abalone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandcrafted by Cues Master\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for consistent playability and lasting durability, this cue delivers a solid hit with premium aesthetics—perfect for players seeking a distinctive custom cue.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43446670852144,"sku":null,"price":25000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul31_2026_09_40_28AM.png?v=1785462042"},{"product_id":"cues-master-custom-cue-butterfly-design","title":"Cues Master Custom Cue – Butterfly Design","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eElevate your game with this handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eCues Master Custom Cue\u003c\/strong\u003e, featuring a striking \u003cstrong\u003ebutterfly design\u003c\/strong\u003e that showcases expert craftsmanship and timeless elegance. The combination of figured maple and vibrant resin creates a cue that stands out both in appearance and performance.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with resin butterfly points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium resin handle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with matching resin butterfly points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butterfly-style construction with precision craftsmanship\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for players who appreciate both beauty and playability, this cue offers a solid, consistent hit thanks to its radial pin construction, while the butterfly design highlights the artistry behind every handcrafted piece. Whether you're competing or adding to your collection, this cue delivers exceptional style and dependable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43448306008112,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_31_2026_04_59_26_PM.png?v=1785488376"},{"product_id":"spalted-tamarind-cue","title":"Spalted Tamarind X Maple (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eElevate your game with this handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eCues Master Custom Cue\u003c\/strong\u003e, featuring a striking \u003cstrong\u003espalted tamarind wood\u003c\/strong\u003e that showcases expert craftsmanship and timeless elegance. The combination of figured maple and vibrant resin creates a cue that stands out both in appearance and performance.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15.5 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with abalone and plastic ivory points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e spalted tamarind wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with abalone and plastic ivory points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e spalted tamarind and long points construction with precision craftsmanship\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for players who appreciate both beauty and playability, this cue offers a solid, consistent hit thanks to its radial pin construction, while the spalted tamarind wood highlights the artistry behind every handcrafted piece. Whether you're competing or adding to your collection, this cue delivers exceptional style and dependable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43450866663472,"sku":null,"price":30000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_2_2026_06_01_55_PM.png?v=1785664936"},{"product_id":"crimson-legacy-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Ebony Wood Points (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Built from premium \u003cstrong\u003eCanadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue features rich crimson points accented by dark veneers, creating a striking contrast that showcases the natural beauty of the wood. A luxurious \u003cstrong\u003ered crocodile-embossed leather wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e completes the design, delivering a refined look and confident feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWeight:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Red Crocodile-Embossed Leather\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is individually handcrafted, ensuring each piece is one of a kind while meeting the high standards of precision, balance, and craftsmanship that define our brand. Designed for players and collectors alike, the Crimson Legacy pairs classic cue-making tradition with a bold, sophisticated aesthetic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you're matching it with your favorite shaft or adding a standout piece to your collection, this cue is built to perform and made to be admired.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOwn the legacy. Play with distinction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453056778288,"sku":null,"price":15000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/9dce2545-cb3d-4e81-9c1a-82abc0a96fe7.png?v=1785639889"},{"product_id":"royal-eclipse-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt","title":"Maple x Spalted Tamarind 12 pointer (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp\u003e Crafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium figured Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue features \u003cstrong\u003espalted tamarind points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented with \u003cstrong\u003epurple veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a striking contrast that highlights the natural beauty of both woods. Finished with a \u003cstrong\u003eblack crocodile-embossed leather wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e, it offers a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is handcrafted with precision and attention to detail, ensuring each piece is as unique as the player who owns it. Whether paired with your favorite shaft for competitive play or displayed as part of a premium collection, the \u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Eclipse\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers the perfect balance of beauty, craftsmanship, and performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Figured Canadian Maple with Spalted Tamarind Points and Purple Veneers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Crocodile-Embossed Leather\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Figured Canadian Maple with Spalted Tamarind Points and Purple Veneers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for players who appreciate understated luxury, the \u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Eclipse\u003c\/strong\u003e combines premium materials with expert craftsmanship. The figured maple, distinctive spalted tamarind, and bold purple veneers create a cue that is both visually captivating and built for lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandcrafted with precision. Built to perform. Designed to be remembered.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453158522928,"sku":null,"price":20000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/a5426051-3320-4f34-9bcd-7641225901d1.png?v=1785641669"},{"product_id":"celestial-blade","title":"Ebony wood x Celestial Blade (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInspired by the elegance of a legendary sword, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCelestial Blade\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted ebony cue butt that embodies precision, artistry, and timeless design. A meticulously handcrafted abalone sword inlay shimmers under the light, beautifully contrasted by the rich black ebony and clean white ringwork for a striking, sophisticated look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Celestial Blade showcases exceptional craftsmanship and premium materials. Whether matched with your favorite shaft for play or displayed as part of a collection, this cue is a true statement of style and performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWeight:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 17 oz\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ebony wood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlay:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Sword design\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhere craftsmanship meets legendary design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e ⚔️🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453197189168,"sku":null,"price":42000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/d8006a64-94a4-4635-8bc6-69fc5510b84b.png?v=1785642634"},{"product_id":"imperial-heritage-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Spalted Tamarind x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [\u0026amp;:has([data-writing-block])\u0026gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-conten